From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mscorlib.tlb: the type library of mscorlib's COM-visible types, installed and registered beside the framework

Visual Studio 2022 stops at "mscorlib.tlb could not be loaded": the .NET
Framework ships a type library of mscorlib's COM-visible types and Wine Mono
does not. This adds one as a data-only module (like stdole2.tlb), generated
from Mono's MIT-licensed reference assembly source (type list, GUIDs, COM
attributes) and Wine Mono's corlib (members) by wine-sg
tools/mscorlib-tlb/gen.sh. It is installed in Framework and Framework64
v4.0.30319 and registered as {BED7F4EA-1A96-11D2-8F08-00A0C9A6186D} 2.4.
---
diff --git a/configure b/configure
index d1f0b56..272b2e8 100755
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -1259,6 +1259,7 @@ enable_msauddecmft
 enable_mscat32
 enable_mscms
 enable_mscoree
+enable_mscorlib_tlb
 enable_mscorwks
 enable_msctf
 enable_msctfmonitor
@@ -22538,6 +22539,7 @@ wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/mscms enable_mscms
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/mscms/tests enable_tests
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/mscoree enable_mscoree
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/mscoree/tests enable_tests
+wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/mscorlib.tlb enable_mscorlib_tlb
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/mscorwks enable_mscorwks
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/msctf enable_msctf
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/msctf/tests enable_tests
